{% comment %}
  iJewel 3D studio - the page a "Start designing" button lands on.

  The band is the configurator: an optional heading above it, iJewel's 3D tool
  in the frame, and the reassurance lines and links under it. Which tool goes
  in the frame is decided in this order:

    1. any app block added to this section, so an app-based builder still
       takes the slot if one is ever installed.
    2. the 3D configurator, when an embed URL is set. iJewel hands one over in
       the Embedding tab of a file in iJewel Drive - either the whole <iframe>
       snippet or just its src, and this takes both. The URL looks like
       https://ijewel3d.com/<instance>/files/<file id>/embedded, or
       https://ijewel3d.com/drive/files/embedded?tag=...&scope=<folder id>.
       The file has to be public, or the frame loads empty.
       assets/ijewel-studio.js builds the frame once it is near the viewport.
    3. the enquiry card, when neither is there - the shop still takes custom
       work by email and form, so the page is useful before the tool is wired
       up and stays useful if it is ever turned off.

  The builder in the frame is somebody else's page on somebody else's domain,
  so its own branding cannot be restyled from here - a cross-origin frame takes
  none of our CSS. "Cover the builder's logo" is the way round it: a panel laid
  over the frame's top-left corner, in the frame's own background colour, with
  our mark on it. Where the vendor puts its logo is the vendor's decision and
  can move, so every edge of that panel is a setting.

  Looks come from assets/ijewel-studio.css; buttons from assets/eden-actions.css.
  The poster image reuses snippets/homepage-journey-image.liquid - picked image
  first, then a file in Content > Files or assets/, then a pasted URL.

  Every restylable setting is written onto the section element as a CSS custom
  property, with the stylesheet's own value as the fallback, so a setting left
  at "use the default" (a cleared colour, a size of 0) writes nothing at all.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'ijewel-studio.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'ijewel-studio.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- liquid
  assign transparent = 'rgba(0,0,0,0)'

  assign heading_size = section.settings.heading_size | plus: 0
  assign eyebrow_size = section.settings.eyebrow_size | plus: 0
  assign text_size = section.settings.text_size | plus: 0
  assign note_size = section.settings.note_size | plus: 0
  assign content_width = section.settings.content_width | plus: 0
  assign pad_inline = section.settings.padding_horizontal | plus: 0
  assign pad_top = section.settings.padding_top | plus: 0
  assign pad_bottom = section.settings.padding_bottom | plus: 0

  # iJewel's Embedding tab offers the whole <iframe ...> snippet and the bare
  # URL, and pasting either into the one field should work. A snippet is cut
  # down to its src; anything else is taken as the URL it is.
  assign embed_src = section.settings.embed_url | strip

  if embed_src contains 'src='
    assign src_parts = embed_src | split: 'src=' | last | replace: "'", '"' | split: '"'
    assign embed_src = src_parts[1] | default: ''
  endif

  # Only an absolute https URL is ever printed into the frame, so a stray word
  # in the field cannot turn into a relative path on our own domain.
  unless embed_src contains 'https://'
    assign embed_src = ''
  endunless

  assign app_blocks = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == '@app'
      assign app_blocks = app_blocks | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  assign poster_set = false
  if section.settings.poster_image != blank or section.settings.poster_image_asset != blank or section.settings.poster_image_url != blank
    assign poster_set = true
  endif

  assign notes = section.settings.notes | split: '|'

  assign brand_top = section.settings.brand_top | plus: 0
  assign brand_left = section.settings.brand_left | plus: 0
  assign brand_width = section.settings.brand_width | plus: 0
  assign brand_height = section.settings.brand_height | plus: 0
  assign brand_logo_width = section.settings.brand_logo_width | plus: 0
  assign brand_top_mobile = section.settings.brand_top_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_left_mobile = section.settings.brand_left_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_width_mobile = section.settings.brand_width_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_height_mobile = section.settings.brand_height_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_logo_width_mobile = section.settings.brand_logo_width_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_pad = section.settings.brand_pad | plus: 0
  assign brand_pad_mobile = section.settings.brand_pad_mobile | plus: 0
  assign brand_text_size = section.settings.brand_text_size | plus: 0

  assign splash_hold = section.settings.splash_hold | plus: 0 | times: 1000
  assign splash_logo_width = section.settings.splash_logo_width | plus: 0
  assign splash_logo_width_mobile = section.settings.splash_logo_width_mobile | plus: 0
  assign splash_stage_width = section.settings.splash_stage_width | plus: 0
  assign splash_stage_height = section.settings.splash_stage_height | plus: 0
  assign splash_stage_width_mobile = section.settings.splash_stage_width_mobile | plus: 0
  assign splash_stage_height_mobile = section.settings.splash_stage_height_mobile | plus: 0

  assign brand_justify = 'flex-start'
  if section.settings.brand_alignment == 'center'
    assign brand_justify = 'center'
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  The mark on the patch: a picked image first, then a file in Content > Files or
  assets/ by name, then a pasted URL. With none of the three set the wordmark is
  typed out instead, so the panel is never an empty white box.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture brand_src -%}
  {%- if section.settings.brand_image != blank -%}
    {{- section.settings.brand_image | image_url: width: 720 -}}
  {%- elsif section.settings.brand_image_asset != blank -%}
    {%- render 'image-source', file: section.settings.brand_image_asset, width: 720 -%}
  {%- elsif section.settings.brand_image_url != blank -%}
    {{- section.settings.brand_image_url -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign brand_src = brand_src | strip -%}

{%- comment -%}
  width and height on the <img> are only a ratio hint - the stylesheet sets the
  width and leaves the height automatic. The real numbers come from the picked
  image, or from the file when it is one of the shop's own in Content > Files;
  the literal pair is the shipped default's own size, so a file named by hand
  that lives in assets/ still reserves roughly the right box.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign brand_drop = section.settings.brand_image
  if brand_drop == blank and section.settings.brand_image_asset != blank
    assign brand_drop = images[section.settings.brand_image_asset]
  endif
  assign brand_img_width = brand_drop.width | default: 1250
  assign brand_img_height = brand_drop.height | default: 620
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  The mark on the loading cover. The builder shows its own splash while its
  scene downloads, and that splash is inside the frame where nothing of ours
  can reach it - so the cover stays up over the whole stage for a moment after
  the frame reports it has loaded, then fades.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture splash_src -%}
  {%- if section.settings.splash_image != blank -%}
    {{- section.settings.splash_image | image_url: width: 720 -}}
  {%- elsif section.settings.splash_image_asset != blank -%}
    {%- render 'image-source', file: section.settings.splash_image_asset, width: 720 -%}
  {%- elsif section.settings.splash_image_url != blank -%}
    {{- section.settings.splash_image_url -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign splash_src = splash_src | strip -%}

{%- liquid
  assign splash_drop = section.settings.splash_image
  if splash_drop == blank and section.settings.splash_image_asset != blank
    assign splash_drop = images[section.settings.splash_image_asset]
  endif
  assign splash_img_width = splash_drop.width | default: 1188
  assign splash_img_height = splash_drop.height | default: 158
-%}

{%- capture section_styles -%}
  {%- if section.settings.section_background != blank and section.settings.section_background != transparent -%}--ijw-section-bg: {{ section.settings.section_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.heading_color != blank and section.settings.heading_color != transparent -%}--ijw-heading-color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.eyebrow_color != blank and section.settings.eyebrow_color != transparent -%}--ijw-eyebrow-color: {{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.text_color != blank and section.settings.text_color != transparent -%}--ijw-text-color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.note_color != blank and section.settings.note_color != transparent -%}--ijw-note-color: {{ section.settings.note_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.frame_background != blank and section.settings.frame_background != transparent -%}--ijw-frame-bg: {{ section.settings.frame_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.frame_border != blank and section.settings.frame_border != transparent -%}--ijw-frame-border: {{ section.settings.frame_border }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_background != blank and section.settings.button_background != transparent -%}--ijw-button-bg: {{ section.settings.button_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_text_color != blank and section.settings.button_text_color != transparent -%}--ijw-button-ink: {{ section.settings.button_text_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if heading_size > 0 -%}--ijw-heading-size: {{ heading_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if eyebrow_size > 0 -%}--ijw-eyebrow-size: {{ eyebrow_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if text_size > 0 -%}--ijw-text-size: {{ text_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if note_size > 0 -%}--ijw-note-size: {{ note_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  --ijw-frame-height: {{ section.settings.frame_height }}px;
  --ijw-frame-height-mobile: {{ section.settings.frame_height_mobile }}px;
  {%- if content_width > 0 and section.settings.full_width == false -%}--ijw-shell-max: {{ content_width }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.brand_cover -%}
    {%- if section.settings.brand_background != blank and section.settings.brand_background != transparent -%}--ijw-brand-bg: {{ section.settings.brand_background }};{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.brand_text_color != blank and section.settings.brand_text_color != transparent -%}--ijw-brand-ink: {{ section.settings.brand_text_color }};{%- endif -%}
    --ijw-brand-top: {{ brand_top }}px;
    --ijw-brand-left: {{ brand_left }}px;
    --ijw-brand-width: {{ brand_width }}px;
    --ijw-brand-height: {{ brand_height }}px;
    --ijw-brand-logo-width: {{ brand_logo_width }}px;
    --ijw-brand-top-mobile: {{ brand_top_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-left-mobile: {{ brand_left_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-width-mobile: {{ brand_width_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-height-mobile: {{ brand_height_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-logo-width-mobile: {{ brand_logo_width_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-pad: {{ brand_pad }}px;
    --ijw-brand-pad-mobile: {{ brand_pad_mobile }}px;
    --ijw-brand-justify: {{ brand_justify }};
    {%- if brand_text_size > 0 -%}--ijw-brand-text-size: {{ brand_text_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.splash_cover -%}
    {%- if section.settings.splash_background != blank and section.settings.splash_background != transparent -%}--ijw-splash-bg: {{ section.settings.splash_background }};{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_logo_width > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-logo-width: {{ splash_logo_width }}px;{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_logo_width_mobile > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-logo-width-mobile: {{ splash_logo_width_mobile }}px;{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_stage_width > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-stage-width: {{ splash_stage_width }}%;{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_stage_height > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-stage-height: {{ splash_stage_height }}%;{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_stage_width_mobile > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-stage-width-mobile: {{ splash_stage_width_mobile }}%;{%- endif -%}
    {%- if splash_stage_height_mobile > 0 -%}--ijw-splash-stage-height-mobile: {{ splash_stage_height_mobile }}%;{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if pad_inline > 0 -%}--ijw-pad-inline: {{ pad_inline }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.custom_padding -%}--ijw-pad-top: {{ pad_top }}px;--ijw-pad-bottom: {{ pad_bottom }}px;{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

<section
  class="ijewel-studio{% if section.settings.full_width %} ijewel-studio--wide{% endif %}{% if section.settings.fill_screen %} ijewel-studio--fullscreen{% endif %}"
  style="{{ section_styles }}"
>
  <div class="ijw-shell">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.eyebrow != blank or section.settings.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="ijw-head{% if section.settings.alignment == 'left' %} ijw-head--left{% endif %}">
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="ijw-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          {%- if section.settings.heading_is_h1 -%}
            <h1 class="ijw-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
          {%- else -%}
            <h2 class="ijw-title">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}
          <div class="ijw-text">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="ijw-frame">
      {%- if app_blocks > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}
            <div class="ijw-app" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{% render block %}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

      {%- elsif embed_src != blank -%}
        <ijewel-studio
          data-src="{{ embed_src | escape }}"
          data-title="{{ section.settings.embed_title | default: 'Design your own jewellery' | escape }}"
          data-lazy="{% if section.settings.lazy_load %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          data-hold="{% if section.settings.splash_cover %}{{ splash_hold }}{% else %}0{% endif %}"
        >
          <noscript>
            <iframe
              src="{{ embed_src | escape }}"
              title="{{ section.settings.embed_title | default: 'Design your own jewellery' | escape }}"
              allow="autoplay; camera; fullscreen; xr-spatial-tracking; web-share"
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
          </noscript>
        </ijewel-studio>

        <div class="ijw-poster{% if section.settings.splash_cover %} ijw-poster--cover{% endif %}">
          {%- if poster_set -%}
            <div class="ijw-poster__image">
              {%- render 'homepage-journey-image',
                image: section.settings.poster_image,
                asset: section.settings.poster_image_asset,
                image_url: section.settings.poster_image_url,
                alt: section.settings.poster_image_alt,
                placeholder: 'product-1',
                sizes: '100vw',
                width: 1600,
                height: 1200
              -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.splash_cover and splash_src != blank -%}
            <img
              class="ijw-poster__mark"
              src="{{ splash_src }}"
              alt="{{ section.settings.brand_text | default: shop.name | escape }}"
              width="{{ splash_img_width }}"
              height="{{ splash_img_height }}"
              loading="eager"
            >
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if section.settings.loading_label != blank -%}
            <p class="ijw-poster__label">{{ section.settings.loading_label | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if section.settings.brand_cover -%}
          <div class="ijw-brand{% if section.settings.brand_hide_mobile %} ijw-brand--desktop{% endif %}">
            {%- if brand_src != blank -%}
              <img
                class="ijw-brand__image"
                src="{{ brand_src }}"
                alt="{{ section.settings.brand_text | default: shop.name | escape }}"
                width="{{ brand_img_width }}"
                height="{{ brand_img_height }}"
                loading="eager"
              >
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="ijw-brand__text">{{ section.settings.brand_text | default: shop.name | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

      {%- else -%}
        <div class="ijw-fallback">
          {%- if section.settings.fallback_heading != blank -%}
            <h2>{{ section.settings.fallback_heading | escape }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.fallback_text != blank -%}
            <div class="ijw-text">{{ section.settings.fallback_text }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.fallback_label != blank -%}
            <div class="ijw-actions">
              <a class="eden-action eden-action--solid" href="{{ section.settings.fallback_link | default: '#' }}">
                {{- section.settings.fallback_label | escape -}}
              </a>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if notes.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="ijw-notes">
        {%- for note in notes -%}
          {%- assign note_text = note | strip -%}
          {%- if note_text != blank -%}
            <li class="ijw-note">{{ note_text | escape }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.primary_label != blank or section.settings.secondary_label != blank -%}
      <div class="ijw-actions">
        {%- if section.settings.primary_label != blank -%}
          <a
            class="eden-action eden-action--{{ section.settings.primary_style }}"
            href="{{ section.settings.primary_link | default: '#' }}"
            {% if section.settings.primary_new_tab %}target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}
          >
            {{- section.settings.primary_label | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.secondary_label != blank -%}
          <a
            class="eden-action eden-action--{{ section.settings.secondary_style }}"
            href="{{ section.settings.secondary_link | default: '#' }}"
          >
            {{- section.settings.secondary_label | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.aside != blank -%}
      <p class="ijw-aside">{{ section.settings.aside }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "3D design studio",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-ijewel-studio",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "The 3D designer", "info": "Paste the embed your builder gives you. Pencil: the share or embed link for the builder. iJewel: open the file in iJewel Drive, go to Embedding, and copy what it gives you - the file must be public or the frame loads empty." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "embed_url", "label": "Embed URL or iframe code", "info": "Paste either the bare URL or the whole <iframe> snippet - the src is taken out of it either way. Leave empty to show the enquiry card instead. An app block added to this section wins over whatever is here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "embed_title", "label": "Frame title for screen readers", "default": "Design your own jewellery" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "lazy_load", "label": "Load the designer when it scrolls into view", "default": true, "info": "Untick to load it with the page. A 3D scene is a heavy first load." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "fill_screen", "label": "Fill the screen", "default": false, "info": "The designer takes the whole window below the header, with no border, padding or wash. The two heights below are ignored." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "frame_height", "label": "Frame height (desktop)", "min": 400, "max": 1400, "step": 20, "unit": "px", "default": 760 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "frame_height_mobile", "label": "Frame height (mobile)", "min": 320, "max": 1200, "step": 20, "unit": "px", "default": 560 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "loading_label", "label": "Line shown while it loads", "info": "Leave empty to hide it.", "default": "Loading the designer" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Cover the builder's loading screen", "info": "The builder shows its own splash while its scene downloads, inside the frame where our CSS cannot reach it. This holds our own cover over the stage - the part of the frame the piece is drawn in - for a moment after the frame has loaded, then fades it out. It deliberately leaves the builder's own panel showing, so the page never looks empty while it loads. Lengthen the hold if their splash flashes up at the end of it; widen the cover if it shows at the edges." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "splash_cover", "label": "Cover the builder's loading screen", "default": true },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_hold", "label": "Hold the cover after the frame loads", "min": 0, "max": 20, "step": 1, "unit": "s", "default": 6 },
    { "type": "color", "id": "splash_background", "label": "Cover colour", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "splash_image", "label": "Mark on the cover" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "splash_image_asset", "label": "Or a file name", "info": "A file in Content > Files or in the theme's assets folder.", "default": "eden-raine-logo.png" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "splash_image_url", "label": "Or an image URL" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_logo_width", "label": "Mark width (desktop)", "min": 80, "max": 600, "step": 10, "unit": "px", "default": 240 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_logo_width_mobile", "label": "Mark width (mobile)", "min": 60, "max": 400, "step": 10, "unit": "px", "default": 150 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_stage_width", "label": "Cover width (desktop)", "min": 10, "max": 100, "step": 2, "unit": "%", "default": 66, "info": "How much of the frame's width the stage takes, before the builder's own panel starts." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_stage_height", "label": "Cover height (desktop)", "min": 10, "max": 100, "step": 2, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_stage_width_mobile", "label": "Cover width (mobile)", "min": 10, "max": 100, "step": 2, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "splash_stage_height_mobile", "label": "Cover height (mobile)", "min": 10, "max": 100, "step": 2, "unit": "%", "default": 44 },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Cover the builder's logo", "info": "The builder is a page on the vendor's own domain, so its branding cannot be restyled from here. This lays a panel over the frame's top-left corner and puts our own mark on it. Match the panel colour to the builder's background, then nudge the size until the vendor's logo is gone." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "brand_cover", "label": "Cover the builder's logo", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_text", "label": "Wordmark", "default": "Eden Raine", "info": "Used when none of the three image fields below is filled in, and as the image's alt text." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "brand_image", "label": "Logo image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_image_asset", "label": "Or a file name", "info": "A file in Content > Files or in the theme's assets folder, e.g. Eden_Raine_Logo_Full.png.", "default": "Eden_Raine_Logo_Full.png" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_image_url", "label": "Or an image URL" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "brand_background", "label": "Panel colour", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "brand_text_color", "label": "Wordmark colour" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "brand_alignment", "label": "Mark sits", "options": [ { "value": "left", "label": "Left" }, { "value": "center", "label": "Centred" } ], "default": "left" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "brand_pad", "label": "Inset from the panel edge (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 96, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 32 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "brand_pad_mobile", "label": "Inset from the panel edge (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 64, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "brand_text_size", "label": "Wordmark size", "min": 0, "max": 48, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 0, "info": "0 keeps the stylesheet's size." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "brand_top", "label": "Panel from the top (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 200, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
